---
// Approved Living Systems composition; native Astro, no client framework.

---
<section class="ls-visual-episode ls-container">
<div class="ls-episode-copy">
<p class="ls-eyebrow">THE MORNING GETS TO THE POINT</p>
<h2>WHAT MOVED.<br/>WHAT DIDN’T.<br/>
<span class="ls-stroke">WHAT NEEDS YOU.</span>
</h2>
<div class="ls-episode-dek">
<p>A single Morning Briefing gathers changed documents and useful snapshots. Review marked parts without reopening every routine. An unchanged source can be a good night’s work.</p>
</div>
</div>
<figure aria-label="A morning with a shorter list" class="ls-scene ls-morning-scene" data-frame="0" data-scene="true" data-scene-count="3">
<div class="ls-scene-chrome">
<span>
<i>
</i>
<i>
</i>
<i>
</i>
</span>
<b>A morning with a shorter list</b>
<span>FLOW / ILLUSTRATION</span>
</div>
<div class="ls-scene-body">
<div class="ls-morning-heading">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-sun" fill="none" height="25" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="25" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="4">
</circle>
<path d="M12 2v2">
</path>
<path d="M12 20v2">
</path>
<path d="m4.93 4.93 1.41 1.41">
</path>
<path d="m17.66 17.66 1.41 1.41">
</path>
<path d="M2 12h2">
</path>
<path d="M20 12h2">
</path>
<path d="m6.34 17.66-1.41 1.41">
</path>
<path d="m19.07 4.93-1.41 1.41">
</path>
</svg>
<div>
<span>MORNING BRIEFING</span>
<h3>Good morning. Here’s what moved.</h3>
</div>
<b>07:30</b>
</div>
<div class="ls-morning-rows">
<button aria-pressed="true" data-scene-select="0" type="button">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-file-text" fill="none" height="22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M6 22a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2.4 2.4 0 0 1 1.704.706l3.588 3.588A2.4 2.4 0 0 1 20 8v12a2 2 0 0 1-2 2z">
</path>
<path d="M14 2v5a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h5">
</path>
<path d="M10 9H8">
</path>
<path d="M16 13H8">
</path>
<path d="M16 17H8">
</path>
</svg>
<span>
<b>Team status</b>
<small>Table + chart refreshed · note ready</small>
</span>
<em>Changed</em>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" data-scene-select="1" type="button">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-check" fill="none" height="22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M20 6 9 17l-5-5">
</path>
</svg>
<span>
<b>Competitor watch</b>
<small>No meaningful source change</small>
</span>
<em>No change</em>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
<button aria-pressed="false" data-scene-select="2" type="button">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-circle-alert" fill="none" height="22" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10">
</circle>
<line x1="12" x2="12" y1="8" y2="12">
</line>
<line x1="12" x2="12.01" y1="16" y2="16">
</line>
</svg>
<span>
<b>Research brief</b>
<small>One named page could not be reached</small>
</span>
<em>Attention</em>
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="17" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="17" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
</div>
<div class="ls-morning-detail">
<p data-scene-panel="0">
<b>Review a part.</b> Keep the result or restore that part. Later edits are protected from a blind rollback.</p>
<p data-scene-panel="1" hidden="">
<b>Keep your attention.</b> An unchanged source does not need a fresh paragraph.</p>
<p data-scene-panel="2" hidden="">
<b>See the exception.</b> An unreachable source is an explained problem, never invented evidence.</p>
</div>
</div>
<figcaption class="ls-scene-controls">
<span class="ls-scene-status">
<span data-scene-caption="0">Changed / review the marked parts</span>
<span data-scene-caption="1" hidden="">No change / a useful quiet result</span>
<span data-scene-caption="2" hidden="">Needs attention / an exception you can understand</span>
</span>
<span>
<button aria-label="Next step: A morning with a shorter list" data-scene-next="true" type="button">Next <svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-right" fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M5 12h14">
</path>
<path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
<button aria-label="Replay: A morning with a shorter list" data-scene-replay="true" type="button">
<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-rotate-ccw" fill="none" height="14" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="14" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<path d="M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8">
</path>
<path d="M3 3v5h5">
</path>
</svg>
</button>
</span>
</figcaption>
</figure>
</section>
